<details class="rules-drawer">
  <summary>Field manual</summary>
  <div class="rules-content">
    <div>
      <span class="step-number">01</span><h3>Watch I</h3>
      <p>Draw six cards, assign two Commands, commit the rest as Support, and take two actions. Supply and Command tags carry forward.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="step-number">02</span><h3>Watch II</h3>
      <p>Draw six more cards and repeat. Command abilities are new, while crisis Readiness retains tags prepared during Watch I.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Endure</h3>
      <p>After Watch II, resolve the visible crisis using Readiness from both Watches. Then clean up; Supply normally expires and Data banks.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rules-warning">
      <b>Loss conditions</b>
      <p>Stability 0 ends the run. Fleet 5 ends it unless you have 2 Colonies and the Defense Grid.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</details>
